    <Description>is a functional half flip macro.
a rocket mechanic in which you turn faster.
the delay is made to be play in 30 to 50ms if u have more ping than that you should change the delay between line 15 to line 17.
This is made for custom controls, instead of right click to jump is now space to jump and right click for the cam ball.
Also the directional aerol isnt with Q/E, is with the side buttons, E is M4(back button) and Q is M5(Forward button)</Description>
